{"id":"1943602163445133837","kind":"article","title":"善用废纸篓","author":"Terence Tao","original_authors":["Terence Tao"],"original_source_urls":["https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/use-the-wastebasket/"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"Terry Tao","date":"2025-08-27","updated":"2025-08-27","votes":78,"comment_count":1,"minutes":2,"chars":725,"keywords":["科研写作","失败","项目管理","迭代","知识记录"],"summary":"陶哲轩提醒，失败和未发表的草稿也有保存价值：项目可能需要缩小、改方向、搁置，论文也可能必须重写，甚至丢弃无用引理。工作者既要懂得坚持，也要识别死胡同；数字时代备份成本低，重要修改前应留存旧稿，未发表的失败成果或许能供日后借鉴。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1943602163445133837","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"3lJQMveB\">若以为成功源于成功，那便是一种误解；人们的成功，更多时候是通过失败铸就的。无论是箴言、学习、忠告还是榜样，其教诲之深远，都远不及一次失败。 (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samuel_Smiles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Samuel Smiles</a>)</blockquote><p data-pid=\"mARuKwwK\">并非每一个想法都能开花结果，也并非每一份初稿都能成为终稿的理想蓝本。即便对于最顶尖的数学家而言，亦是如此。</p><p data-pid=\"1k2gyeaT\">总有这样一些时候：一个项目无法按照最初的设想顺利推进，你不得不缩减其规模、调整其重心，或将其彻底束之高阁；或者，某个你曾投入大量时间的引理，最终却发现对论文并无太大助益，只得忍痛丢弃，或将其留待他用；又或者，一篇写至半途的论文，其结构明显并非最佳，需要从头彻底重写。（确实，我最引以为傲的论文中，有些就因经历了一次或数次彻底重写，而与初稿相比几乎面目全非。）</p><p data-pid=\"FTRjupw7\">人必须懂得何时应当坚持不懈、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-patient/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">保持耐心</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，何时又应务实求真、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/be-sceptical-of-your-own-work/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面对现实</a>；固执地在死胡同里钻牛角尖，并非最有效利用时间的方式；而发表自己工作中的每一个零碎成果，也并非一直是确保出版物达到理想质量的最好方法。（尽管有时，以某种形式<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/make-your-work-available/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">展示</a>你阶段性的成果仍然是值得的）。当然，在如今数字时代，备份所有工作既便宜又便捷，在对任何论文进行「大手术」<b>之前</b>，你务必应当这样做。</p><p data-pid=\"4tu0truK\">即便是那些令人汗颜的错误成果（我手头就有不少这样的东西，所幸它们从未面世），也应当私下妥善保存。因为你永远不知道将来是否能从中发掘出可取之处，而记录那些日后应当避免的错误，本身就是一件好事。例如，这能帮助你<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/learn-the-limitations-of-your-tools/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">认识到你所用工具的局限</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>。</p><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"7RT3nm3R\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 gemini-2.5-pro，校对 <span class=\"nolink\">Nerv-Ikari</span><br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://terrytao.wordpress.com/career-advice/use-the-wastebasket/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Use the wastebasket | What's new</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 保持耐心 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1926976019300094709\" href=\"#/post/1926976019300094709\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 认识到你所用工具的局限 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"1935759986283254667\" href=\"#/post/1935759986283254667\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"1939620723808244220","title":"学习并时常温习你的领域","author":"Terence Tao","votes":102,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Terry Tao"},{"id":"1945781278394787244","title":"保持灵活性","author":"Terence Tao","votes":41,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Terry Tao"},{"id":"1926976019300094709","title":"保持耐心","author":"Terence Tao","votes":145,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"1935759986283254667","title":"认识到你所用工具的局限","author":"Terence Tao","votes":68,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"1917527213198279519","title":"陶哲轩论时间管理","author":"Terence Tao","votes":1131,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸引用本文"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1919852962982912583","title":"重力转向：为什么你的导师能「自由落体」，而你不能？","author":"radimentary","votes":97,"minutes":7,"reason":"跨学派视角 · radimentary"},{"id":"545276399","title":"有效的深度工作不仅取决于时间，还取决于强度","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":23,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"1976595620086162802","title":"你和你的研究","author":"Gwern Branwen","votes":182,"minutes":52,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Gwern Branwen"},{"id":"1921171513228362430","title":"应对 ADHD 的笔记","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":549,"minutes":37,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Fernando Borretti"},{"id":"621439732","title":"排遣行为","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[]}